2026-10-25T16:22:01.9184082Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nixos.org/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9200471Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9283872Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9292554Z [0m
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9293343Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9293744Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9293913Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9294121Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9294665Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9294993Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9295297Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9295621Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9295758Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9296094Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9296519Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9296882Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9297155Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9297276Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9297459Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9297655Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9297854Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9298156Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9298258Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9298353Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9298474Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9298735Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9299116Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9302975Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9303099Z I will:
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9303240Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9303471Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9303944Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9304293Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9304600Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9304822Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9305042Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9305369Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9305659Z    /root
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9316252Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9316681Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9325968Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9326379Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9326646Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9328042Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9328514Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9347434Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9348231Z [34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9356745Z [0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9357370Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9357731Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9357932Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9358140Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9358417Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9358623Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9358961Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9359164Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9359309Z If you would like to
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9359670Z see the output, try like this:
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9359893Z 
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9360139Z   $ curl -L -o install-nix https://nixos.org/nix/install
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9360557Z   $ sh ./install-nix
2026-10-25T16:22:01.9360741Z 
